Template: netdeploy/admin-access
Type: select
Choices: all networks, this computer only
Default: all networks
Description: Where should the admin web UI listen?
 netdeploy's admin web UI and API need a signed-in account (the first one is
 created with a setup code shown after installation).
 .
 "all networks" listens on every address of this machine; "this computer
 only" listens on 127.0.0.1, reachable from elsewhere through an SSH tunnel.
 You can change it later in Settings, or with dpkg-reconfigure netdeploy.

Template: netdeploy/admin-port
Type: string
Default: 8443
Description: Admin web UI port:
 The HTTPS port for the admin web UI and API.
